<title>UK: DMG appoints new Frequent Borrowers Coverage head.</title>
<headline>DMG appoints new Frequent Borrowers Coverage head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said in a statement on Monday it had appointed Jessica Pulay as head of the Frequent Borrowers Coverage Group.</p>
<p>She will be a managing director within the Debt Capital Markets.</p>
<p>Pulay moved from Goldman Sachs where she had worked since 1991.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
